      "lines": [
        "佛是一个“捕获器”. 它就象铠甲一样阻挡住宇宙射线中的大",
        "多数粒子，使它们不能到达地面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由于一些行星际站和宇宙飞船飞往月球及绕着月球飞",
        "行，才得以发现月球是没有磁场的. 通过宇宙飞船进行探索，",
        "目前还没有发现金星和火星有磁场."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**问题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）在地球上的一定地点，磁针总是指向一定的方向. 这",
        "如何解释？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）地球的两个磁极各位于何处？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）怎样表明地球的磁南极在北边，而磁北极在南边？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（4）怎样解释“磁暴”的产生？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（5）什么是磁力异常地区？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "6",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（6）可以观察到最大的磁力异常的地区在哪里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**159. 电话**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "大家对电话筒都是很熟悉的. 电话筒的一端装着一个**受",
        "话器**$\\textcircled{1}$，在通话时要把它贴近耳朵，而另一端装着一个**送话",
        "器**$\\textcircled{2}$. 受话器和送话器通过一条共用的电路与电话线另一端",
        "的一个同样的仪器相连接."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图342所示是送话器构造的示意图. 送话器的主要零件",
        "是振膜6（用钢或经过压制的碳做成的薄片）和装入碳靴2的"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": "source-footnote-1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\textcircled{1}$ 受话器——能隔着遥远的距离传送声音的仪器."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": "source-footnote-2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\textcircled{2}$ 送话器——又叫微音器，是一种能够感到微弱声音的仪器."
      ]
    },
